nitial investment from 19 investment firms, consultancies and system integrators (led by TPG; Advent, Bain Capital and Brookfield co-lead founding partners). OpenAI agreed to acquire Tomoro (about 150 Forward Deployed Engineers and Deployment Specialists) for DeployCo. No dedicated chief executive is named on the sponsor or company pages read; leaders omitted.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.adventinternational.com/news/openai-launches-the-openai-deployment-company-to-help-businesses-build-around-intelligence/","name":"Advent International","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-11","evidence":"OpenAI is launching the OpenAI Deployment Company, a new company designed to help organizations build and deploy AI systems they can rely on every day across their most important work."},"website":{"url":"https://www.baincapitalprivateequity.com/portfolio","name":"Bain Capital Private Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Name: The OpenAI Deployment Company ... View company website (links to https://openai.com/business/the-openai-deployment-company/)"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.baincapitalprivateequity.com/portfolio","name":"Bain Capital Private Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"INDUSTRY: Technology | YEAR: 2026 | DeployCo is an AI deployment and transformation services company formed in partnership with OpenAI to help enterprises build, integrate, and scale production-grade AI solutions."},"subsector":{"url":"https://www.baincapitalprivateequity.com/portfolio","name":"Bain Capital Private Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"DeployCo is an AI deployment and transformation services company formed in partnership with OpenAI"},"country":{"url":"https://www.adventinternational.com/investments/","name":"Advent International","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"OpenAI Deployment Company | May 2026 | Helping organizations build and deploy AI systems | Technology | United States"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.adventinternational.com/news/openai-launches-the-openai-deployment-company-to-help-businesses-build-around-intelligence/","name":"Advent International","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-11","evidence":"Boston, MA, May 11, 2026 – OpenAI is launching the OpenAI Deployment Company"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.baincapitalprivateequity.com/portfolio","name":"Bain Capital Private Equity","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"help enterprises build, integrate, and scale production-grade AI solutions"}},"leaders":[],"holding":{"sponsor":"Bain Capital","status":"current","status_note":"Co-lead founding partner since 2026; OpenAI holds majority control","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Minority stake","value_creation_plan":"DeployCo is an AI deployment and transformation services company formed in partnership with OpenAI to help enterprises build, integrate, and scale production-grade AI solutions.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.baincapitalprivateequity.com/portfolio","notes":"Bain Capital portfolio lists year 2026, Americas, Technology."}},{"name":"Casaforte","website":"https://www.casaforte.it","description":"Italian self-storage operator that develops and manages modern, functional self-storage facilities for individuals and companies, with 24 facilities and about 80,000 square metres across Italy.","sector":"Real estate","subsector":"Self-storage","country":"Italy","founded_year":2000,"business_model":"B2B and B2C (monthly self-storage rental)","revenue":8900000,"revenue_currency":"EUR","revenue_period":"FY2024","leaders":[{"role":"other","name":"Cesare Carcano","title":"Founder and Chairman","source_url":"https://www.ardian.com/news-insights/press-releases/ardian-signs-agreement-acquire-majority-stake-casaforte-italys-leading","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Cesare Carcano, Founder and Chairman, Casaforte"},{"role":"ceo","name":"Massimiliano Gasperi","title":"Amministratore Delegato (CEO)","source_url":"https://www.varesenews.it/notizie-sponsorizzate/massimiliano-gasperi-amministratore-delegato-casaforte/","source_kind":"secondary","evidence":"Proprio pochi giorni fa è stata ufficializzata la nomina di Massimiliano Gasperi ad Amministratore Delegato del gruppo. (sponsored article, 22 March 2021)"}],"notes":"Registered as Casaforte S.p.A. / Casaforte Self-Storage S.p.A., Via Alassio 10, 20156 Milano (P.IVA 00430320127). Revenue is MF-Milano Finanza's reading of the 2024 accounts: value of production (valore della produzione) close to EUR 8.9m ('sfiorava'), operating costs EUR 7.5m, net profit EUR 88k; recorded as approximately EUR 8.9m. MF reports Ardian invested about EUR 100m for about 80%, founder Carcano keeping about 20% (press, not confirmed by Ardian). CEO appointment dates from a 2021 sponsored article; the 2026 Ardian release names only the founder and Chairman.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.ardian.com/news-insights/press-releases/ardian-signs-agreement-acquire-majority-stake-casaforte-italys-leading","name":"Ardian","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-03-10","evidence":"Through an integrated operating model and disciplined asset management, Casaforte develops and manages modern, functional self-storage facilities designed to meet both temporary and long-term needs. ... Casaforte operates 24 facilities nationwide, representing approximately 80,000 square meters of total space."},"website":{"url":"https://www.ardian.com/expertise/our-portfolio?keyword=Casaforte","name":"Ardian","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"https://www.casaforte.it/it"},"country":{"url":"https://www.casaforte.it/it","name":"Casaforte","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Via Alassio, 10 | 20156 – Milano | C.F/P.IVA 00430320127 | Reg. Imprese MI"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.casaforte.it/it/chi-siamo","name":"Casaforte","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Casaforte Self Storage: dal 2000 domatori di disordine."},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.casaforte.it/it/chi-siamo","name":"Casaforte","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Un abbonamento mensile alla tua stanza in più. ... Privati Aziende ... I nostri self storage sono ideali per il tuo business"},"subsector":{"url":"https://www.ardian.com/expertise/our-portfolio?keyword=Casaforte","name":"Ardian","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Real Estate | Casaforte | Italy | 18 June 2026 | Self-storage"},"revenue":{"url":"https://www.milanofinanza.it/news/ardian-compra-i-self-storage-di-casaforte-dal-prezzo-ai-nuovi-azionisti-tutti-i-dettagli-dell-202603101839351485","name":"MF-Milano Finanza","kind":"press","as_of":"2026-03-10","evidence":"Secondo i dati di bilancio 2024, l'ultimo disponibile, il valore della produzione sfiorava quota 8,9 milioni a fronte di costi operativi per 7,5 milioni."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"ARDIAN","status":"current","status_note":"Majority stake agreed March 2026; held (portfolio date 18 June 2026)","asset_class":"Real estate","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"Ardian will combine management's experience with its strategic and financial support and international network to strengthen Casaforte's leadership in Italy, through organic growth and selective acquisitions, as part of a pan-European self-storage platform.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.ardian.com/news-insights/press-releases/ardian-signs-agreement-acquire-majority-stake-casaforte-italys-leading","notes":"Ardian Real Estate; platform also includes Costockage and Atout-Box in France; a further EUR 200m planned for Spain and Germany."}},{"name":"SEG (Sports Entertainment Group)","website":"https://www.seginternational.com","description":"International management agency representing over 1,000 talents across four divisions: SEG Football, SEG Cycling, Prodigy SEG (gaming) and SEG Artists (entertainment).","sector":"Media & Entertainment","subsector":"Sports and talent representation agency","country":"Netherlands","founded_year":2000,"business_model":"B2C talent representation and B2B intermediary advice to clubs and teams","email":"info@seginternational.com","email_type":"generic","employees":200,"employees_text":"around 200 agents and staff in 40 countries","employees_as_of":"2026-09-15","leaders":[{"role":"other","name":"Kees Vos","title":"Founder","source_url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=78428fa2-6971-4d51-8a99-9fa54736a496","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Kees Vos, Founder, SEG, says: \"We have always had a strategy of both organic growth and growth through M&A...\""},{"role":"ceo","name":"Rachel Gómez Y Maseland","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://www.adformatie.nl/carriere/seg-benoemt-rachel-gomez-y-maseland-als-ceo","source_kind":"secondary","evidence":"Rachel Gómez Y Maseland is per deze maand ceo van internationaal managementbureau Sports Entertainment Group (SEG). (18 November 2021)"}],"notes":"Legal entity SEG International BV, MediArena 12, 1116 BC Amsterdam (KvK 34139303); offices in Amsterdam, Barcelona, London, Milan and Girona. Net revenues grew at c. 40% CAGR over the three years to 2026 (Partners Group); no absolute revenue disclosed. CEO appointment is from November 2021 trade press; the 2026 Partners Group and Prodigy releases name only founder Kees Vos, so the CEO is recorded as secondary. Merged with Prodigy Agency (gaming) effective 12 January 2026.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=78428fa2-6971-4d51-8a99-9fa54736a496","name":"Partners Group","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-15","evidence":"SEG is an international management agency representing over 1,000 top talents across four divisions: SEG Football, SEG Cycling, Prodigy SEG (gaming) and SEG Artists (entertainment)."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.seginternational.com/about","name":"SEG","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"SEG was founded in 2000 by childhood friends Kees Vos and Alex Kroes."},"country":{"url":"https://www.seginternational.com/about","name":"SEG","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"SEG International BV | MediArena 12, 1116 BC | Amsterdam-Amstelvoorde | KvK 34139303"},"email":{"url":"https://www.seginternational.com/contact","name":"SEG","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Email us | info@seginternational.com"},"employees":{"url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=78428fa2-6971-4d51-8a99-9fa54736a496","name":"Partners Group","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-15","evidence":"SEG currently works with around 200 agents and staff in 40 countries."},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=78428fa2-6971-4d51-8a99-9fa54736a496","name":"Partners Group","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-09-15","evidence":"In addition, SEG acts as an independent intermediary, advising football clubs and cycling teams on player and rider recruitment and contract negotiations."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Partners Group","status":"current","status_note":"Largest outside shareholder since September 2026; founder and existing shareholders remain invested","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Growth investment","value_creation_plan":"Partners Group will support SEG in pursuing targeted acquisitions in the highly fragmented talent agency market, extending its presence into other sports and adjacent industries, and expanding services such as commercial partnerships and brand development; it plans to more than double its initial equity investment.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.partnersgroup.com/en/news-and-views/press-releases/investment-news/detail?news_id=78428fa2-6971-4d51-8a99-9fa54736a496","notes":"Partners Group's first lead investment in the sports industry; stake size not disclosed."}},{"name":"Yad2","website":"https://www.yad2.co.il/","description":"Operator of Israel's leading online marketplaces across property, automotive, jobs and general classifieds.","sector":"Marketplaces, Data, and Consumer","subsector":"Online classifieds marketplace","country":"Israel","business_model":"Marketplace (online classifieds)","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Tomy Schoenfeld","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://www.calcalistech.com/ctechnews/article/r100lvqnzzl","source_kind":"press","evidence":"\"We have very ambitious plans. ... We were sold to Apax London, the biggest player in the global classifieds world...,\" Yad2 CEO Tomy Schoenfeld told the company's management in a call (Calcalist, 2 December 2025)."}],"notes":"Apax agreed to acquire Yad2 from KKR-controlled AVIV Group for about $950 million (Calcalist, 1 December 2025; valuation reported at about 20 times EBITDA). Axel Springer bought Yad2 from Walla in 2014 (NIS 806m per Globes; NIS 820m per Calcalist). Revenue and EBITDA reported in the press are projections from sale documents, so none are recorded. Company site blocks automated access.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/yad2/","name":"Apax Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Headquartered in Israel, Yad2 operates the country's leading online marketplaces across property, automotive, jobs, and general classifieds."},"website":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/yad2/","name":"Apax Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Website | https://www.yad2.co.il/"},"country":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/yad2/","name":"Apax Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Country | Israel | Deal status | Current"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/yad2/","name":"Apax Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Sector | Marketplaces, Data, and Consumer"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.apax.com/partnerships/yad2/","name":"Apax Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"The platform is the preferred destination for buyers and sellers, with Yad2 playing a critical role for agents, home developers and dealers as a marketing channel ... and a large base of unique consumer-to-consumer listings."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Apax","status":"current","status_note":"Acquired from KKR-backed AVIV Group; agreement signed December 2025, Apax lists investment year 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","notes":"Reported price about $950 million (Calcalist). Apax deal team listed: Mark Sykes, Or Berlinsky, Ramy Matar, Steven Kooyers, Zehavit Cohen."}},{"name":"Fortidia","website":"https://www.fortidia.com","description":"Global commerce enabler for MSMEs and consumers, providing shipping, fulfilment, logistics, marketing and print solutions through franchised and direct brands including Mail Boxes Etc., World Options, PACK & SEND, PostNet and AlphaGraphics.","sector":"Services & Industrials","subsector":"Shipping, fulfilment, print and marketing services (franchise network)","country":"Italy","founded_year":1993,"business_model":"Franchise (with direct presence); serves MSMEs (B2B) and consumers","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Paolo Fiorelli","title":"Chairman and CEO","source_url":"https://www.fortidia.com/governance","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Paolo Fiorelli | Chairman and CEO | Paolo joined Fortidia at the end of 1993. He has been Chief Executive Officer of MBE Italy and other European subsidiaries since 2001 and of the Group since its inception in 2009, becoming its Chairman in 2016."},{"role":"cfo","name":"Samuele Spaccia","title":"Group Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.fortidia.com/governance","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Samuele Spaccia | Group Chief Financial Officer | Samuele joined Fortidia in 2014 as Finance & Controlling Manager of the Group."}],"notes":"Fortidia is the brand identity of MBE Worldwide S.p.A. (Viale Lunigiana 35-37, 20125 Milan; VAT 05393070965), subject to management and coordination of Magellano S.a r.l. In 2024 its platform (3,200+ Business Solutions Centers in 57 countries, over 14,000 associates, mostly franchised) generated EUR 1.45bn (US$1.65bn) of system-wide gross revenue; this is network sales, not company revenue, so revenue and employees are left blank. BC Partners acquired a majority stake from the founding Fiorelli family and funds managed by Oaktree; signed 16 December 2025, closed 6 March 2026; Fiorelli retains a significant stake.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/fortidia-completes-strategic-partnership-with-bc-partners/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-03-06","evidence":"Fortidia is a global commerce enabler for MSMEs and consumers thanks to its platform including brands providing shipping, fulfillment, logistics, marketing and print solutions: Mail Boxes Etc. (outside the U.S. and Canada.), World Options, PACK & SEND, PostNet, ParcelValue, Spedingo, GEL Proximity, AlphaGraphics, Kwik Kopy Australia, Multicopy, and Print Speak."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/fortidia-announces-strategic-partnership-with-bc-partners-to-accelerate-global-growth/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2025-12-16","evidence":"Founded in 1993 and headquartered in Milan (Italy), Fortidia is a global leader in providing shipping, fulfilment, print, and marketing solutions, primarily to micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (\"MSMEs\")."},"country":{"url":"https://www.fortidia.com/contact-us","name":"Fortidia","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Global Headquarters: Viale Lunigiana, 35-37 20125 Milan (IT)"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/portfolio/fortidia/","name":"BC Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Sector Services & Industrials | Strategy Private Equity | Investment year 2025 | Region Europe | Investment status Unrealised"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.fortidia.com/our-business","name":"Fortidia","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Through our trusted brands ... we empower our partners with the independence to leverage our established business model ... Meanwhile, our direct presence in the field reinforce brand consistency ... this hybrid approach drives both agile growth and strategic control"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"BC Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Majority stake acquired from the Fiorelli family and Oaktree funds; signed December 2025, closed March 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"BC Partners will work with the Fortidia team to accelerate growth by enhancing the client offering, expanding the international network, and pursuing M&A opportunities in a fragmented market.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.bcpartners.com/news/fortidia-completes-strategic-partnership-with-bc-partners/","notes":"Bilateral transaction; first investment of BC Partners Fund XII; investment status Unrealised. Terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Mecaer Aviation Group","website":"https://www.mecaer.com/","description":"Leading international provider of aircraft systems and services for the helicopter, business aviation and general aviation markets, designing and producing flight control, actuation and landing systems and providing cabin interiors, MRO and mission customisation.","sector":"Aerospace & Defence","subsector":"Flight-critical systems and components; cabin interiors and MRO","country":"Italy","founded_year":1995,"business_model":"B2B (supplier to OEMs and Tier-1 suppliers)","employees":950,"employees_text":"950+ Employees","revenue":242000000,"revenue_currency":"EUR","revenue_period":"FY2025","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Marco Acca","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Marco Acca, CEO of Mecaer Aviation Group, said: \"We are proud to embark on a new phase of development alongside PAI and Fondo Italiano. I would like to thank Fondo Italiano, Stellex and my predecessor Bruno Spagnolini...\""},{"role":"other","name":"Bruno Spagnolini","title":"Chairman","source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Bruno Spagnolini, Chairman of Mecaer Aviation Group, said: \"The transaction ensures full strategic and operational continuity for the Group and the management team...\""}],"notes":"Mecaer Aviation Group (MAG) S.p.A., Via per Arona 46, 28021 Borgomanero (NO). Established in 1995 as a spin-off of Group Agusta. Seven production and maintenance facilities in Italy, the United States and Canada (company site says 8 facilities worldwide). Employee count is from the undated company homepage, which also shows 224 ML EUR in sales (an earlier year). MF-Milano Finanza reports the deal values the company at EUR 350m (press, unconfirmed by sponsors).","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-05","evidence":"Established in 1995 as a spin-off of Group Agusta, Mecaer Aviation Group is a leading international provider of aircraft systems and services for the helicopter, business aviation and general aviation markets."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-05","evidence":"Established in 1995 as a spin-off of Group Agusta"},"country":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-05","evidence":"Headquartered in Borgomanero, Italy, Mecaer operates production facilities in Italy, the United States and Canada"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-05","evidence":"serves the sector's leading global Original Equipment Manufacturers (OEMs), as well as major international Tier-1 suppliers."},"employees":{"url":"https://www.mecaer.com/","name":"Mecaer Aviation Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"8 | Facilities Worldwide | 950+ | Employees | 224 | ML€ in sales | 100+ | Engineers in R&D"},"revenue":{"url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","name":"PAI Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-05","evidence":"In 2025, Mecaer recorded revenues of €242 million, substantially doubling its performance compared to that recorded at the time of FICC's entry in 2021."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"PAI Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Binding agreement (May 2026) for PAI MMF II and Fondo Italiano FICC II to acquire 100%; completion expected later in 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"PAI and FII will work alongside CEO Marco Acca, Chairman Bruno Spagnolini and the management team to strengthen Mecaer's competitive position by expanding its presence across new and existing best-selling platforms, supporting consolidation opportunities in the aerospace sector and driving further growth in Italy, the rest of Europe and North America.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.paipartners.com/mediaitem/pai-partners-and-fondo-italiano-dinvestimento-sign-partnership-agreement-to-support-the-next-phase-of-growth-for-mecaer-aviation-group/","notes":"Second investment of PAI Mid-Market Fund II. Sellers: FICC (Fondo Italiano) and Stellex Capital Management; founding families (S.B.I. S.r.l.), LGT Capital Partners and management reinvest. Per MF, majority passes to PAI."}},{"name":"BWXT Medical","website":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/","description":"A leading product developer and service provider for the global nuclear medicine industry, developing, manufacturing and delivering medical isotopes and radiopharmaceuticals for diagnostic imaging and radiotherapeutic treatments.","sector":"Healthcare","subsector":"Medical isotopes and radiopharmaceuticals","country":"Canada","business_model":"B2B","email":"isotopequestions@bwxt.com","email_type":"generic","employees":300,"employees_text":"more than 300 employees located in Ottawa and Vancouver","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Vittorio Puppo","title":"President, BWXT Medical Ltd.","source_url":"https://www.bwxt.com/bwxt-names-vittorio-puppo-president-of-medical-business/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"BWX Technologies, Inc. (NYSE: BWXT) has appointed Vittorio Puppo as president of BWXT Medical Ltd., effective August 12, 2024."}],"notes":"BWXT Medical Ltd., 447 March Road, Ottawa (Kanata), ON K2K 1X8, with a Vancouver regional office. On 31 July 2026 BWX Technologies agreed to sell its medical business (BWXT Medical plus Kinectrics' stable medical isotopes business) to Nordic Capital in a transaction valued at up to $800 million, retaining a minority stake; closing expected in 2026 or Q1 2027 (BWXT 10-Q). BWXT says it roughly tripled the business's revenue since acquiring it in 2018; no standalone revenue is disclosed. President appointment dates from August 2024.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/","name":"BWXT Medical","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"We are a leading product developer and service provider for the global nuclear medicine industry."},"subsector":{"url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/insights/press-releases/bwxt-to-sell-medical-business-to-nordic-capital/","name":"Nordic Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-08-03","evidence":"advance its market presence in radiopharmaceuticals, including developing, manufacturing and delivering products for diagnostic imaging and radiotherapeutic treatments."},"country":{"url":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/contact/","name":"BWXT Medical","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Ottawa Operations | 447 March Road | Ottawa, ON, | Canada | K2K 1X8 | Vancouver Regional Office"},"email":{"url":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/contact/","name":"BWXT Medical","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Community Inquiries: Phone: 1.833.657.4565 | email: isotopequestions@bwxt.com"},"employees":{"url":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/about/","name":"BWXT Medical","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Our dedicated team of more than 300 employees located in Ottawa and Vancouver are developing innovative, full-service solutions."},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.bwxtmedical.com/about/","name":"BWXT Medical","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"developing, manufacturing and delivering products for diagnostic imaging and radiotherapeutic treatments"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Nordic Capital","status":"current","status_note":"Definitive agreement signed 31 July 2026 to acquire from BWX Technologies; closing expected by end-2026 (or Q1 2027 per BWXT 10-Q); BWXT retains a minority stake","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Carve-out","value_creation_plan":"Nordic Capital sees significant potential to scale the business and expand access to cutting-edge radiopharmaceutical therapy; under its ownership the business is expected to scale, expand capabilities and advance its market presence in radiopharmaceuticals.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.nordiccapital.com/insights/press-releases/bwxt-to-sell-medical-business-to-nordic-capital/","notes":"Transaction valued at up to $800 million; includes Kinectrics' stable medical isotopes business. BWXT continues to provide isotope and radiochemical expertise."}},{"name":"Integris Composites","website":"https://integriscomposites.com/","description":"Global provider of bespoke, high-performance, lightweight survivability composite products (armour) that protect people working in hostile environments, used across land vehicles, aircraft and naval vessels.","sector":"Industrial Tech","subsector":"Lightweight composite armour and survivability solutions (defence)","country":"Netherlands","business_model":"B2B and B2G (defence OEMs, defence and law enforcement agencies)","email":"info@IntegrisComposites.com","email_type":"generic","employees":370,"employees_text":"~370 amazing Integris employees across the globe","employees_as_of":"2026-04-08","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Andrew Bonham","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://integriscomposites.com/triton/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Andrew Bonham, CEO of Integris, commented: \"We want to thank Agilitas for their support and expertise...\""}],"notes":"Formerly part of Royal TenCate (TenCate Advanced Armour); Agilitas backed the buyout from Royal TenCate in March 2021 and rebranded it Integris. The April 2026 sale announcement says headquartered in Amsterdam with production in the US, France and Denmark; the contact page labels the Vienna, VA (Washington DC) office as 'Head Office', so the US may be the operating head office. More than 30 years of experience in lightweight composite armour (Triton).","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://integriscomposites.com/triton/","name":"Integris Composites","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-04-08","evidence":"Integris is a global provider of bespoke, high-performance, lightweight survivability composite products which protect people working in hostile environments. The Company's portfolio of highly engineered products is used across land vehicles, aircraft, and naval vessels and is mission-critical to end-user safety."},"country":{"url":"https://integriscomposites.com/triton/","name":"Integris Composites","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-04-08","evidence":"Integris is headquartered in Amsterdam, the Netherlands, with production facilities in the United States (US), France, and Denmark and offices covering sales in more than 50 countries."},"sector":{"url":"https://www.triton-partners.com/news/triton-partners-to-acquire-integris-composites","name":"Triton Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-04-07","evidence":"News | Industrial Tech | Mid-Market Private Equity"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.triton-partners.com/news/triton-partners-to-acquire-integris-composites","name":"Triton Partners","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-04-07","evidence":"The company is a strategic partner to the world's leading defence Original Equipment Manufacturers as well as defence and law enforcement agencies."},"email":{"url":"https://integriscomposites.com/contact/","name":"Integris Composites","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Fairfax Square II Suite 210 8075 Leesburg Pike Vienna, VA 22182 +1 740 928 0326 info@IntegrisComposites.com"},"employees":{"url":"https://integriscomposites.com/triton/","name":"Integris Composites","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-04-08","evidence":"a strong cooperation between Agilitas, the Board and ~370 amazing Integris employees across the globe."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Triton Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Triton Fund 6 signed agreements to acquire from Agilitas funds in April 2026, subject to regulatory approvals","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"Triton will support Integris with further capital, operational expertise and know-how derived from investments such as RENK Group to scale its capacities and capabilities to meet increasing customer demand.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.triton-partners.com/news/triton-partners-to-acquire-integris-composites","notes":"Triton Mid-Market; terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Ascent Sports Group","website":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com","description":"Technology and media company focused on improving participation, engagement and connectivity across youth sports, owning LiveBarn (streaming and analytics), Spordle (registration and league management) and GameSheet (live scoring and stats).","sector":"Technology, Media & Telecommunications","subsector":"Youth and amateur sports technology (streaming, registration, scoring)","country":"United States","founded_year":2026,"business_model":"B2B2C (platforms serving leagues, governing bodies, venues and families)","email":"info@ascentsportsgroup.com","email_type":"generic","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Gary Swidler","title":"Chief Executive Officer","source_url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Gary Swidler | Chief Executive Officer | Leads Ascent Sports Group. Previously President and Chief Financial Officer of Match Group"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Benjamin Beauvais-Naubert","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Benjamin Beauvais-Naubert | Chief Financial Officer | Leads finance for Ascent Sports Group, overseeing financial strategy, planning, and reporting across the portfolio."},{"role":"coo","name":"Kyle Hebenstreit","title":"Chief Strategy and Operations Officer","source_url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Kyle Hebenstreit | Chief Strategy and Operations Officer | Oversees strategy and operations across Ascent's portfolio."},{"role":"other","name":"Steven Brien","title":"Chief Administrative Officer","source_url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Steven Brien | Chief Administrative Officer | A critical executive at Spordle, where he served as COO and CFO."}],"notes":"Formed January 2026 as a GTCR Leaders Strategy partnership with Gary Swidler (former President and CFO of Match Group). First acquisition LiveBarn (closed 24 March 2026; Montreal-based; Ares Credit funds remain an investor; Ray Giroux named LiveBarn CEO), followed by GameSheet and Spordle. Company says it is 'headquartered across offices in the US and Canada'; country recorded as United States from GTCR's Chicago release and the 'US and Canada' statement, which is a judgement. No revenue disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","name":"Ascent Sports Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Ascent is a technology and media company focused on improving participation, engagement and connectivity across youth sports. It is the technology leader in youth hockey and serves other major sports as well."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","name":"Ascent Sports Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Founded January 2026, backed by GTCR"},"country":{"url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","name":"Ascent Sports Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Headquartered across offices in the US and Canada"},"email":{"url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","name":"Ascent Sports Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"mailto:info@ascentsportsgroup.com"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.ascentsportsgroup.com/about","name":"Ascent Sports Group","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Ascent aims to deliver an integrated user experience where registration, secure payments, scheduling and team management, real-time stats, game video and player analytics are all available in one platform. The goal is to lower costs and friction for organizations and families"},"sector":{"url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gtcr-announces-partnership-with-gary-swidler-to-form-ascent-sports-group-302665433.html","name":"GTCR via PR Newswire","kind":"wire","as_of":"2026-01-20","evidence":"Ascent Sports Group is a newly formed technology and media platform established by GTCR in partnership with Gary Swidler."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"GTCR","status":"current","status_note":"Formed January 2026 as a GTCR Leaders Strategy partnership with CEO Gary Swidler","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Buyout","value_creation_plan":"GTCR partnered with Gary Swidler to pursue opportunities in a large, fragmented market, investing in products and services that simplify youth and amateur sports experiences, improve accessibility and better connect sports communities through technology, identifying, partnering with and building companies.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/gtcr-announces-partnership-with-gary-swidler-to-form-ascent-sports-group-302665433.html","notes":"Platform built by acquisition: LiveBarn (March 2026), GameSheet and Spordle. Deal type recorded as Buyout for a GTCR-controlled platform build; GTCR does not state its ownership percentage."}},{"name":"International Aerospace Coatings (IAC)","website":"https://iac.aero/","description":"Leading provider of aircraft painting solutions for OEMs, major airlines and operators, and MRO providers, which also provides engineering and advanced asset management solutions through its Eirtech Aviation Services division.","sector":"Transportation & Logistics","subsector":"Aircraft painting and aviation services (on-airport hangars)","country":"United States","founded_year":1980,"business_model":"B2B (multi-year contractual agreements with OEMs, airlines, lessors and MRO providers)","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Martin O'Connell","title":"Group CEO","source_url":"https://iac.aero/our-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Our Team | Martin O'Connell | Group CEO"},{"role":"cfo","name":"Cathal Ryan","title":"Group CFO","source_url":"https://iac.aero/our-team/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Cathal Ryan | Group CFO"}],"notes":"Dual headquarters: US Headquarters at 5251 California Street, Irvine, CA and European Headquarters at Shannon Airport, Co. Clare, Ireland; country recorded as United States (US HQ listed first by H.I.G. and the company). Operates 25 hangars across 11 sites in the U.S. and Europe. H.I.G. completed the acquisition on 15 May 2026 from Tiger Infrastructure Partners Fund III (which bought it from Vance Street Capital in 2022); terms not disclosed. No revenue or headcount disclosed.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://hig.com/news/h-i-g-capital-completes-acquisition-of-iac/","name":"H.I.G. Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-15","evidence":"Headquartered in Irvine, California, and Shannon, Ireland, IAC is a leading provider of aircraft painting solutions for original equipment manufacturers (\"OEMs\"), major airlines and operators, and maintenance, repair, and overhaul providers. IAC also provides engineering and advanced asset management solutions through its Eirtech Aviation Services (\"EAS\") division."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://hig.com/news/h-i-g-capital-completes-acquisition-of-iac/","name":"H.I.G. Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-15","evidence":"Founded in 1980, IAC is a leader in aircraft painting and aviation services. The Company operates a global footprint of 25 hangars across 11 sites located in the U.S. and Europe."},"country":{"url":"https://iac.aero/","name":"IAC","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"US Headquarters | 5251 California Street, Suite 170 | Irvine, CA 92617 ... European Headquarters | East Ramp, Shannon Airport, | Co. Clare, Ireland"},"sector":{"url":"https://hig.com/portfolio/international-aerospace-coatings-iac/","name":"H.I.G. Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":null,"evidence":"Sector Transportation & Logistics | Location United States & Europe | Invested 2026 | Status Active | Fund Infrastructure"},"business_model":{"url":"https://hig.com/news/h-i-g-capital-completes-acquisition-of-iac/","name":"H.I.G. Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-05-15","evidence":"IAC's multi-year contractual agreements, combined with predictable aircraft service cycles, provide significant revenue visibility."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"H.I.G. Capial","status":"current","status_note":"Acquisition completed 15 May 2026 by an H.I.G. Infrastructure affiliate from Tiger Infrastructure Partners Fund III","asset_class":"Infrastructure","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"With H.I.G.'s experience and resources, IAC plans to expand its geographic footprint, invest in additional hangar capacity, and selectively pursue add-on acquisitions.","value_creation_source_url":"https://hig.com/news/h-i-g-capital-completes-acquisition-of-iac/","notes":"H.I.G. portfolio page: Fund Infrastructure, Invested 2026, Status Active. Plan quoted is the IAC CEO's statement in H.I.G.'s release."}},{"name":"Tangent Technologies","website":"https://tangentmaterials.com/","description":"Leading manufacturer of high-performance synthetic materials (HDPE synthetic lumber, sheet and structural products) used for outdoor living, site amenities, structural applications and marine decking, made with post-consumer and post-industrial recycled feedstock.","sector":"Industrials","subsector":"Recycled HDPE synthetic lumber and building materials","country":"United States","founded_year":2003,"business_model":"B2B manufacturer","employees":700,"employees_text":"700+ Employees","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Kevin Potthoff","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://www.platinumequity.com/news/platinum-equity-to-acquire-tangent-technologies/","source_kind":"sponsor","evidence":"Tangent CEO Kevin Potthoff said, \"We look forward to partnering with Platinum Equity and expect their experience and operational capabilities will help support our long-term growth objectives.\""}],"notes":"TANGENT Technologies, LLC (Tangent Materials), 10111 Sullivan Road, Aurora, Illinois 60506; six U.S. facilities. Platinum Equity agreed the acquisition